---
// About.astro

const expertise = [
  'Google Ads',
  'Meta Ads',
  'SQL & Data Analysis',
  'GA4 / GTM',
  'HubSpot',
  'Revenue Operations',
  'AI Tool Setup',
  'Process Automation',
  'AEO / GEO',
  'Marketing Automation',
  'Tableau',
];
---

<section id="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">

      <!-- Left: name card -->
      <div class="aside">
        <div>
          <div class="name">Danny Byers</div>
          <div class="title-label">Founder, d2b2</div>
        </div>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="credentials">
          <div class="cred">
            <span class="cred-label">Based in</span>
            <span class="cred-value">San Diego, CA</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cred">
            <span class="cred-label">Education</span>
            <span class="cred-value">Vanderbilt MSDS</span>
            <span class="cred-value">UC San Diego BS</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cred">
            <span class="cred-label">Focus</span>
            <span class="cred-value">RevOps &amp; Paid Growth</span>
          </div>
          <div class="cred">
            <span class="cred-label">Availability</span>
            <span class="cred-value">Project-based engagements</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: bio -->
      <div class="bio">
        <p>
          Most marketing decisions still happen on gut feel and monthly reports
          that arrive too late to act on. Danny takes a different approach,
          applying data science thinking to paid growth and revenue operations:
          reproducible systems, clean attribution, and analysis that gives
          executives clear answers instead of seasonal guesses.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every engagement follows the same model. Audit what exists, build
          what's missing, teach your team how it works, and hand over the keys.
          The goal isn't a long retainer. It's a business that can run its own
          marketing stack after the work is done.
        </p>
        <p>
          The name is a play on the work: D. Byers, databases, data-driven B2B.
          The focus is on companies where marketing has been reactive and
          underpowered. The opportunity is making it precise.
        </p>
        <div class="philosophy-grid">
          <div class="philosophy-block">
            <div class="phil-header">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="0" y="0" width="9" height="9" fill="#CFAE70"/>
                <rect x="11" y="0" width="9" height="9" fill="none" stroke="#CFAE70" stroke-width="1"/>
                <rect x="0" y="11" width="9" height="9" fill="none" stroke="#CFAE70" stroke-width="1"/>
                <rect x="11" y="11" width="9" height="9" fill="#CFAE70"/>
              </svg>
              <span class="phil-tag">Extreme Ownership</span>
            </div>
            <p class="phil-body">We don't sit on our hands. We actively look for solutions. That's the whole job.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="philosophy-block">
            <div class="phil-header">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
                <rect x="0" y="0" width="9" height="9" fill="#CFAE70"/>
                <rect x="11" y="0" width="9" height="9" fill="none" stroke="#CFAE70" stroke-width="1"/>
                <rect x="0" y="11" width="9" height="9" fill="none" stroke="#CFAE70" stroke-width="1"/>
                <rect x="11" y="11" width="9" height="9" fill="#CFAE70"/>
              </svg>
              <span class="phil-tag">Simple by Design</span>
            </div>
            <p class="phil-body">No overengineered solutions. Clean processes, clear documentation, and nothing built that creates another problem to solve.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ul class="proof-points">
          <li>Managed and optimized $1M+ in Google Ads and Meta spend against true revenue attribution, not platform-reported ROAS</li>
          <li>Designed GTM and GA4 cross-domain tracking architectures connecting multiple web properties into a single clean data stream</li>
          <li>Built PMAX campaign structures with custom asset groups and bid optimization grounded in Ad Rank signal analysis</li>
          <li>Developed AEO content pipelines targeting AI search engines including Perplexity, ChatGPT, and Google SGE</li>
          <li>Built HubSpot CRM workflows, lead scoring, and automation that eliminate manual handoffs between marketing and sales</li>
          <li>SQL and Tableau analysis surfacing revenue patterns across ad platforms, CRM, and web analytics for executive reporting</li>
        </ul>

        <ul class="expertise">
          {expertise.map(item => <li>{item}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.6fr;
    gap: 80px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .aside {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
    position: sticky;
    top: 80px;
  }

  .name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .title-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .divider {
    width: 36px;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--gold);
  }

  .credentials { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }

  .cred {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .cred-label {
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .cred-value {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .bio {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .bio p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .philosophy-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--border);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  .philosophy-block {
    padding: 18px 20px;
    background: var(--gold-pale);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .phil-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .phil-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .phil-body {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .proof-points {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .proof-points li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .proof-points li::before {
    content: '';
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--gold);
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 7px;
  }

  .expertise {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    padding: 24px 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .expertise li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-weight: 300;
  }

  .expertise li::before {
    content: '';
    width: 3px;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--gold);
    border-radius: 50%;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
    .aside { position: static; }
    .philosophy-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .expertise { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
